:"original","quote":"丙辰〖1〗，帝幸太学。问诸儒曰：“圣人幽赞神明〖2〗，仰观俯察，始作八卦。后圣重之为六十四〖3〗，立爻以极数〖4〗；凡斯大义，罔有不备。而夏有《连山》〖5〗，殷有《归藏》〖6〗，周曰《周易》〖7〗；《易》之书，其故何也〖8〗？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":399,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114},{"id":"shaodi-q-o083","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-59cdbac86f299ef21222","layer":"original","quote":"《易》博士淳于俊对曰〖9〗：“包羲因燧皇之图而制八卦〖10〗，神农演之为六十四〖11〗，黄帝、尧、舜通其变。三代随时〖12〗，质文各由其事〖13〗。故《易》者，变易也；名曰《连山》，似山出纳〔云〕气〖14〗，连天地也；《归藏》者，万事莫不归藏于其中也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":127},{"id":"shaodi-q-o083-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-59cdbac86f299ef21222","layer":"original","quote":"《易》博士淳于俊对曰〖9〗：“包羲因燧皇之图而制八卦〖10〗，神农演之为六十四〖11〗，黄帝、尧、舜通其变。三代随时〖12〗，质文各由其事〖13〗。故《易》者，变易也；名曰《连山》，似山出纳〔云〕气〖14〗，连天地也；《归藏》者，万事莫不归藏于其中也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":127},{"id":"shaodi-q-o084","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8e790986833fb21e2a1b","layer":"original","quote":"帝又曰：“若使包羲因燧皇而作《易》，孔子何以不云‘燧人氏没包羲氏作’乎〖15〗？”俊不能答。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"shaodi-q-o084-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8e790986833fb21e2a1b","layer":"original","quote":"帝又曰：“若使包羲因燧皇而作《易》，孔子何以不云‘燧人氏没包羲氏作’乎〖15〗？”俊不能答。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46},{"id":"shaodi-q-o085-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ead1d935118013c72759","layer":"original","quote":"帝又问曰：“孔子作《彖》、《象》〖16〗，郑玄作注〖17〗；虽圣、贤不同〖18〗，其所释经义，一也〖19〗。今《彖》、《象》不与经文相连；而注连之〖20〗，何也？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82},{"id":"shaodi-q-o086","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-998e12a5fdca2569f81b","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“郑玄合《彖》、《象》于经者，欲使学者寻省易了也〖21〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"shaodi-q-o086-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-998e12a5fdca2569f81b","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“郑玄合《彖》、《象》于经者，欲使学者寻省易了也〖21〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"shaodi-q-o087-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-a2b2821786e5e9a14e9f","layer":"original","quote":"帝曰：“若郑玄合之，于学诚便；则孔子曷为不合，以了学者乎？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":404,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"shaodi-q-o088","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5fc198f6ece977a95bcf","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“孔子恐其与文王相乱〖22〗，是以不合；此圣人以不合为谦。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":405,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"shaodi-q-o088-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5fc198f6ece977a95bcf","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“孔子恐其与文王相乱〖22〗，是以不合；此圣人以不合为谦。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":405,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34},{"id":"shaodi-q-o089-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ed18acce43ae53ea0ca7","layer":"original","quote":"帝曰：“若圣人以不合为谦，则郑玄何独不谦邪？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":406,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23},{"id":"shaodi-q-o090","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4c92f3212716c110dcc4","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“古义弘深，圣问奥远〖23〗，非臣所能详尽。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":407,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"shaodi-q-o090-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4c92f3212716c110dcc4","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“古义弘深，圣问奥远〖23〗，非臣所能详尽。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":407,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27},{"id":"shaodi-q-o091-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-359ff244846df28c583b","layer":"original","quote":"帝又问曰：“《系辞》云‘黄帝、尧、舜，垂衣裳而天下治〖24〗’，此包羲、神农之世为无衣裳〖25〗。但圣人化天下〖26〗，何殊异尔邪〖27〗？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":408,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":71},{"id":"shaodi-q-o092","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-adbe3de2a3331acea44b","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“三皇之时〖28〗，人寡而禽兽众，故取其羽皮而天下用足。及至黄帝，人众而禽兽寡，是以作为衣裳以济时变也〖29〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61},{"id":"shaodi-q-o092-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-adbe3de2a3331acea44b","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“三皇之时〖28〗，人寡而禽兽众，故取其羽皮而天下用足。及至黄帝，人众而禽兽寡，是以作为衣裳以济时变也〖29〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61},{"id":"shaodi-q-o093-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-7911d319f4c23315f6cc","layer":"original","quote":"帝又问：“乾为天〖30〗，而复为金，为玉，为老马，与细物并邪〖31〗？”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":410,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36},{"id":"shaodi-q-o094","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-4af5f2e059ab1901f18b","layer":"original","quote":"俊对曰：“圣人取象〖32〗，或远或近；近取诸物，远则天地。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":411,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"shaodi-q-o094-judgment","section":"chapter-004","b